# Applied by Cloudflare to the static pages and files. (Worker responses, such as /admin and /api, set their own.)
# No Content-Security-Policy yet: pages use small inline scripts, so a policy needs hashes first (see HANDOVER.md).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
